5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to see the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I want the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city, plus the journey audits on where minutes go.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll check the capital ledger balances and the ticketing contractor fees. Headlines are useless without knowing the actual long-term commitments.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,I will examine the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll look into the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I’m curious why Jonathan is focusing on pre-war shells. Are we expecting structural surprises that could derail any physical upgrade?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, are you worried the ground will swallow our plans? I’m just checking if the crowds actually match the complaints.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I’m not checking the ground, Jonathan. I’m checking the ink. If the ledger is hollow, the shells are the least of our worries.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Benjamin, the ink matters, but so does the memory. I am checking if we are about to repeat a mistake we already made.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"The shells hide voids, not just money. I need to know who else must sign off before we trust any date.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, if the ledger is hollow, we can’t fund the crews. I need to know if the rosters are already empty before we promise anything.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, empty rosters don't fix slow connections. I'm checking if the complaints match the actual stopwatch data.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, hollow rosters are a symptom, not the cause. If the ledger is empty, we can’t hire anyone, regardless of the plan.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, the rosters are the present, but the pilots are the past. I am checking if we have already tried this and failed.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Asuka, empty rosters are a symptom. I need to know who else must say yes before we trust any delivery date.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, I hear you, but I need to know if the people to run the plan will simply appear.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
